flowchart LR
 Q[Question and bound criteria] --> S[Find sources and baseline]
 S --> X[Run pinned experiment]
 X --> O[Check observed evidence]
 O --> N{New finding?}
 N -->|Revise method| A[Update agenda and protocol revision]
 A --> X
 N -->|Evidence sufficient| D[Release report and reproduction bundle]
 U[New software arrives] --> K[Qualify a new release]
 K --> A
 X -. retain every trial .-> L[Durable experiment ledger]
 O --> L
